 R←Test_Dir2_012(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;parms;buff;list1;list2
⍝ Test the `Dir2` method with an empty right argument
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 list1←##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2''
 list2←##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2 ##.FilesAndDirs.PWD,'/'

 →T.PassesIf list1≡list2

 R←T._OK
